        "id": 4269882
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T19:12:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The generated webgpu_cpp.h, and wgpu::Device automatically increments the reference count internally when it\u0027s constructed from a raw handle. Because of this, adding an extra manual reference would cause a memory leak. Also, the .Reference() method doesn\u0027t exist in webgpu_cpp.h.",
