      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T08:28:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I noticed we are unconditionally attaching wgpu::SharedTextureMemoryVkImageLayoutBeginState (and EndState) to the access descriptors.\n\nThis tightly couples the Android HardwareBuffer wrapper exclusively to the vulkan backend. If WebGPU on this Android device falls back to OpenGLES (which is highly common on slightly older or lower-end Android devices), Dawn will see a vulkan-specific chained struct on a GLES backend. Do we know what the behavior would be in that case?\n\nWe should dynamically check the backend type and only attach the VkImageLayout chains if the active backend is actually Vulkan.",
      "fixSuggestions": [
        {
          "fixId": "110cca13_222af5bd",
          "description": "prompt_to_edit API",
          "replacements": [
            {
              "path": "tools/android/webgpu/src/main/cpp/GPUImportedAHB.cpp",
              "range": {
                "startLine": 407,
                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 410,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "    wgpu::Adapter adapter \u003d wrapper-\u003edevice.GetAdapter();\n    wgpu::AdapterInfo info \u003d {};\n    adapter.GetInfo(\u0026info);\n"
            },
            {
              "path": "tools/android/webgpu/src/main/cpp/GPUImportedAHB.cpp",
              "range": {
                "startLine": 411,
                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 412,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "    wgpu::SharedTextureMemoryVkImageLayoutBeginState beginLayout;\n    if (info.backendType \u003d\u003d wgpu::BackendType::Vulkan) {\n        beginLayout \u003d {};\n        beginLayout.oldLayout \u003d VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_GENERAL;\n        beginLayout.newLayout \u003d VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_SHADER_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL;\n        beginDesc.nextInChain \u003d \u0026beginLayout;\n    }\n"
            },
            {
              "path": "tools/android/webgpu/src/main/cpp/GPUImportedAHB.cpp",
              "range": {
                "startLine": 424,
                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 428,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "\n    wgpu::Adapter adapter \u003d wrapper-\u003edevice.GetAdapter();\n    wgpu::AdapterInfo info \u003d {};\n    adapter.GetInfo(\u0026info);\n\n    wgpu::SharedTextureMemoryVkImageLayoutEndState endLayout;\n    if (info.backendType \u003d\u003d wgpu::BackendType::Vulkan) {\n        endLayout \u003d {};\n        endLayout.oldLayout \u003d VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_SHADER_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL;\n        endLayout.newLayout \u003d VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_GENERAL;\n        endState.nextInChain \u003d \u0026endLayout;\n    }\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
