      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T08:28:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please fix this WARNING reported by autoreview issue finding: This RAII wrapper will call Release() when the loop iteration ends. If you also call wgpuSharedTextureMemoryEndAccessStateFreeMembers() (which you should, to free the array), it will also call Release() on the same fences, leading to a double-release. \n\nUse a raw `WGPUSharedFence` handle here and rely on `FreeMembers` to handle the release.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 440,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 440,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "cc7bd81810b44d8508b707ab3bd115cd3adea053",
